  <item>
    <title>Vol.08 一千零一夜·曲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63fe39ecb91c17e69c83a961</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63fe39ecb91c17e69c83a961</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Feb 2023 17:29:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们都知道《一千零一夜》是一本非常经典的来自阿拉伯民间的童话故事书，里面有很多奇妙的充满想象力的故事。那么同样的，有一些音乐作品也是非常具有表现力和故事性的，所以这一期是一本音乐版的《一千零一夜·曲》，让我们一起边听歌边感受这些音乐中光怪陆离的故事吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎您在苹果播客、小宇宙、网易云音乐平台订阅本节目，同时也欢迎您多多分享和评论！其他问题也可发送邮件给我（邮箱在show notes结尾～）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> &nbsp;裘德 - 大年夜怪奇物语</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《大年夜的孤独小孩》</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> &nbsp;Hello Saferide - Long Lost Penpal</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《寻友启事一则》</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> &nbsp;Tizzy Bac - 婚礼歌手</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《婚礼歌手复仇记 - 前传》</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">17:24</a> &nbsp;Guantanamo Bay Surf Club - Escargot Blues</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《哭花的小丑还是选择跳上火车》</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> &nbsp;静物乐团 - 四天</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《他和她的异国Crush》</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">26:05</a> &nbsp;End</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 / 蒜皮 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划&amp;文案&amp;剪辑 / 蒜皮</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面（原稿） / matsugoda[韩]</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面（后期） / 蒜皮</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱 / fanfan_music@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
