  <item>
    <title>Vol.04 香港于我的12h白日梦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63099379ea3aed95e5336c3e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63099379ea3aed95e5336c3e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Aug 2022 03:45:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不能出门的日子里，总是特别想念之前的自由时光。</span></p><p><span>四年前，我曾在香港短暂逗留了12小时。</span></p><p><span>今天的我，凭借仅存的记忆和留存的照片，试图串联起那个冬天用脚步丈量的香港岛。</span></p><p><span>多一张船票！要不要一起走？</span></p><p><span>欢迎来即刻找我玩！@不剥蒜皮儿</span></p><p></p><p><span>Timeline&amp;Song List /</span></p><p><span>- Intro &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;此次出行的契机（侧田 - 决战二世祖）</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> &nbsp;坐上了通往尖沙咀的列车（艾敬 - 我的1997）</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> &nbsp;沿着弥敦道顺着咖喱味找到了重庆大厦</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> &nbsp;中环至半山扶梯形形色色的小街道（The Cranberries - Dreams）</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> &nbsp;茶餐厅文化&amp;九记牛腩&amp;惊喜的盲盒餐厅（雷同二友 - 口水像浪花）</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a> &nbsp;招牌的街头美学&amp;五颜六色的港铁站（Twins - 下一站天后）</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1611">26:51</a> &nbsp;路过可可爱爱的幼稚园（The Pancakes - 脑残游记）</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1917">31:57</a> &nbsp;在入夜后的维港边吹风（at17 - 良夜）</span></p><p><span>- Outro 返程（新青年理发厅 - 世界是一列由东向西驶往的火车）</span></p><p></p><p><span>BGM &amp; 引用 /</span></p><p><span>The Mamas &amp; the Papas - California Dreamin'</span></p><p><span>Lullatone - Whistling in an Office</span></p><p><span>ゴンチチ - Friend</span></p><p><span>Lullatone - ballet bop</span></p><p><span>黎允文 - 再会，小小太空人</span></p><p><span>THE BOOTLEGS 靴腿 - 失去爱情的摩托车手</span></p><p></p><p><span>主播 / 蒜皮</span></p><p><span>邮箱 / fanfan_music@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
