  <item>
    <title>Vol.03 不要慌不要慌，太阳下了有月光</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62da8d1892f0689a31f5051d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62da8d1892f0689a31f5051d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Jul 2022 11:42:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🌕🌖🌗🌘🌑🌒🌓🌔</span></p><p><span>07.13 本年度最大的超级月亮，07.20 人类月球日，最近的月亮是模范员工。</span></p><p><span>整理了几首和月亮有关的歌曲，愿能伴你晒月光。</span></p><p><span>哪一种月亮都好，哪一束月光都亮。</span></p><p><span>希望你今天开心，如果不开心的话...</span></p><p><span>不要慌不要慌，太阳下了有月光，泡面吃完还有汤，关注闲外之音永远不歌荒。</span></p><p><span>欢迎来即刻找我玩！@不剥蒜皮儿</span></p><p></p><p><span>Timeline&amp;Song List /</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;方大同 - Moon River</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a> &nbsp;徐佳莹&amp;许美静 - 和城里一样的月光(Cover By Me)</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;来自凌晨三点半的加班感悟</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">08:41</a> &nbsp;ハンバート ハンバート - 今晩はお月さん</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;东方人如何用月亮含蓄的表达爱意</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> &nbsp;梁静茹 - 半个月亮</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;柳星雨：“那是我最宝贵最干净的东西，归你了。”</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a> &nbsp;Neil Young - Harvest Moon</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;月亮最忌讳的就是特别圆满</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> &nbsp;苏打绿 - 无眠(Cover By Me)</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1946">32:26</a> &nbsp;The Smashing Pumpkins - Luna</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;如果有一天可以移民到太空</span></p><p></p><p><span>BGM &amp; 引用 /</span></p><p><span>Azuria Sky - Stars</span></p><p><span>一帆cm - 同福客栈的屋顶</span></p><p><span>《武林外传.74回》原声</span></p><p><span>甜梅号 - 月娘总是照着我们</span></p><p><span>Christine Ott - Sexy Moon</span></p><p></p><p><span>主播 / 蒜皮 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>邮箱 / fanfan_music@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
