  <item>
    <title>Vol.02 纽约或哪里的一个雨天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62c11236ebfc753783b1f8a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62c11236ebfc753783b1f8a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Jul 2022 03:51:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>进入雨季之后，天总是感觉闷闷的。拉开手机上的天气预报，看着未来一周60%的降雨机率，我打算分享几首下雨时喜欢听的歌给你。</span></p><p><span>其实场景相关的歌单总是很主观的，我无法确定这些音乐你能否感同身受，但还是希望把聆听时的脑内小剧场分享给你。</span></p><p><span>如果你所在的地区最近也一直预报有雨的话，出门一定要记得带伞呀！</span></p><p><span>以及如果你喜欢本期节目的话，欢迎订阅、收藏、分享，也期待大家在评论区把你下雨时喜欢听的歌曲分享给我！</span></p><p></p><h2><span>Timeline&amp;Song List /</span></h2><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> &nbsp;Timothée Chalamet - Everything Happens To Me</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="264">04:24</a> &nbsp;甜約翰 Sweet John - 降雨机率</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> &nbsp;deca joins - 大雨</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> &nbsp;赵闻达 - Sometimes When It Rains</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">16:14</a> &nbsp;张敬轩 - 过云雨</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">19:22</a> &nbsp;周杰伦 - 你听得到</span></p><p></p><h2><span>BGM &amp; 引用 /</span></h2><p><span>Madeleine Peyroux - Instead</span></p><p><span>Gene Kelly - Singin' In The Rain</span></p><p><span>FKJ - Ylang Ylang</span></p><p><span>ケイタク - My Rhythm</span></p><p></p><p><span>主播 / 蒜皮</span></p><p><span>邮箱 / fanfan_music@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
